What:		/sys/devices/system/node/nodeX/mem_features
Date:		July 2026
Contact:	Linux Memory Management list <linux-mm@kvack.org>
Description:
		Hexadecimal bitmask of the memory-feature capabilities enabled
		on node X, using the NODE_MEMORY_CAP_* bit positions: reclaim,
		demotion, numa_balancing, ltpin, damon, ksm, collapse, hugetlb,
		user_numa and fallback.

		A public node reports every feature (~0). A private node reports
		only the subset its owning driver opted into.
